{
  "title": "Ziyarat at Mada'in — Salman al-Farsi, Hudhayfah al-Yamani, Tahir ibn Imam al-Baqir & Abdullah ibn Jabir (r.a.)",
  "data": "Method of Ziyarah In his book of Misbah al-Za'ir, Sayyid Ibn Tawus has mentioned four forms of ziyarah of Salman. However, I will mention the first form only, which has been also recorded by Shaykh al-Tusi in Tahdhib al-Ahkam. In my book of Hadiyyat al-Za'ir, I have mentioned the fourth form. When you intend to visit Salman, you may stop at his tomb, direct your face towards the kiblah direction, and say the following words:\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَىٰ رَسُولِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA RASOOLIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon the Messenger of Allah\nمُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ\nMOHAMMADIBNE A’BDIL LAAHE\nMuhammad the son of `Abdullah,\nخَاتَمِ ٱلنَّبِيِّينَ\nKHAATAMIN NABIYYEENA\nthe Seal of the Prophets.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَىٰ امِيرِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAA AMEERIL MOAMENEENA\nPeace be upon the Commander of the Faithful,\nسَيِّدِ ٱلْوَصِيِّينَ\nSAYYEDIL WASIYYEENA\nthe chief of the Prophet’s successors.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَىٰ ٱلائِمَّةِ ٱلْمَعْصُومِينَ ٱلرَّاشِدِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAL A-IMMATIL MA’SOOMEENAR RAASHEDEENA\nPeace be upon the Imams; the infallible and rightly guided.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَىٰ ٱلْمَلاَئِكَةِ ٱلْمُقَرَّبِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAL MALAAA-EKATIL MOQARRABEENA\nPeace be upon the archangels.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَاحِبَ رَسُولِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلامِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAAHEBA RASOOLIL LAAHIL AMEENA\nPeace be upon you, O faithful companion of Allah’s Messenger.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ امِيرِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WALIYYA AMEERIL MOAMENEENA\nPeace be upon you, O loyalist to the Commander of the Faithful.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُودَعَ اسْرَارِ ٱلسَّادَةِ ٱلْمَيَامِينِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MOODA-A’ ASRAARIS SAADATIL MAYAAMEENE\nPeace be upon you, O trusted with the secrets of the blessed chiefs.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بَقِيَّةَ ٱللَّهِ مِنَ ٱلْبَرَرَةِ ٱلْمَاضِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA BAQIYYATAL LAAHE MENAL BARARATIL MAAZEENA\nPeace be upon you, O he whom Allah has left from the past dutiful ones.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Abu-`Abdullah.\nوَرَحْمَةُ ٱللَّهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ\nWA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nAllah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nاشْهَدُ انَّكَ اطَعْتَ ٱللَّهَ كَمَا امَرَكَ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA ATA’TAL LAAHA KAMAA AMARAKA\nI bear witness that you obeyed Allah as exactly as He ordered you to do,\nوَٱتَّبَعْتَ ٱلرَّسُولَ كَمَا نَدَبَكَ\nWAT TABA’TAR RASOOLA KAMAA NADABAKA\nfollowed the Messenger as exactly as He directed you to do,\nوَتَوَلَّيْتَ خَلِيفَتَهُ كَمَا الْزَمَكَ\nWA TAWALLAYTA KHALEEFATAHU KAMAA ALZAMAKA\nacted loyally to his vicegerent as exactly as He bound you to do,\nوَدَعَوْتَ إِِلَىٰ ٱلإِهْتِمَامِ بِذُرِّيَّتِهِ كَمَا وَقَفَكَ\nWA DA-A’WTA ELAL EHTEMAAME BE-ZURRIYYATEHI KAMAA WAQAFAKA\ncalled for having care of his offspring as exactly as He used you for,\nوَعَلِمْتَ ٱلْحَقَّ يَقيناً وَٱعْتَمَدْتَهُ كَمَا امَرَكَ\nWA A’LIMTAL HAQQA YAQEENANW WA’TAMADTAHU KAMAA AMARAKA\nand had full acquaintance with the truth and thus you rested upon it as exactly as He ordered you to\nوَاشْهَدُ انَّكَ بَابُ وَصِيِّ ٱلْمُصْطَفَىٰ\nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKA BAABO WASIYYIL MUSTAFAA\nI also bear witness that you are the door to the successor of the Chosen Prophet,\nوَطَريقُ حُجَّةِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلْمُرْتَضَىٰ\nWA TAREEQO HUJJATIL LAAHIL MURTAZAA\nthe path to the well-pleased argument of Allah,\nوَامِينُ ٱللَّهِ فِي مَا ٱسْتُوْدِعْتَ مِنْ عُلُومِ ٱلاصْفِيَاءِ\nWA AMEENUL LAAHE FEEMAS TOODE’TA MIN O’LOOMIL ASFEYAAA-E\nand the trustee of Allah in the knowledge of the Elite Ones with whichHe entrusted you.\nاشْهَدُ انَّكَ مِنْ اهْلِ بَيْتِ ٱلنَّبِيِّ ٱلنُّجَبَاءِ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA MIN AHLE BAYTIN NABIYYIN NOJABAAA-E\nI bear witness that you belong to the outstanding members of the Prophet’s family\nٱلْمُخْتَارِينَ لِنُصْرَةِ ٱلْوَصِيِّ\nALMUKHTAAREENA LE-NUSRATIL WASIYYE\nand you are one of those chosen for supporting the Successor.\nاشْهَدُ انَّكَ صَاحِبُ ٱلْعَاشِرَةِ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA SAAHEBUL A’ASHERATE\nI bear witness that you attained the tenth rank (of faith),\nوَٱلْبَرَاهِينِ وَٱلدَّلاَئِلِ ٱلْقَاهِرَةِ\nWAL BARAAHEENE WAD DALAAA-ELIL QAAHERATE\nyou were given the subduing proofs and demonstrations,\nوَاقَمْتَ ٱلصَّلاَةَ\nWA AQAMTAS SALAATA\nyou performed the prayer,\nوَآتَيْتَ ٱلزَّكَاةَ\nWA AATAYTAZ ZAKAATA\ndefrayed the poor-rate,\nوَامَرْتَ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ\nWA AMARTA BIL-MA’ROOFE\nenjoined the right,\nوَنَهَيْتَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنْكَرِ\nWA NAHAYTA A’NIL MUNKARE\nforbade the wrong,\nوَادَّيْتَ ٱلامَانَةَ\nWA ADDAYTAL AMAANATA\nfulfilled the trust,\nوَنَصَحْتَ لِلَّهِ وَلِرَسُولِهِ\nWA NASAHTA LILLAAHE WA LE-RASOOLEHI\nacted sincerely for Allah and His Messenger,\nوَصَبَرْتَ عَلَىٰ ٱلاذَىٰ فِي جَنْبِهِ\nWA SABARTA A’LAL AZAA FEE JANBEHI\nand endured harm for His sake\nحَتَّىٰ اتَاكَ ٱلْيَقِينُ\nHATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEENO\nuntil death came upon you.\nلَعَنَ ٱللَّهُ مَنْ جَحَدَكَ حَقَّكَ\nLA-A’NAL LAAHO MAN JAHADAKA HAQQAKA\nMay Allah curse those who denied your precedence\nوَحَطَّ مِنْ قَدْرِكَ\nWA HATTA MIN QADREKA\nand belittled your status.\nلَعَنَ ٱللَّهُ مَنْ آذَاكَ فِي مَوَالِيكَ\nLA-A’NAL LAAHO MAN AAZAAKA FEE MAWAALEEKA\nMay Allah curse those who injured you when they harmed your chiefs.\nلَعَنَ ٱللَّهُ مَنْ اعْنَتَكَ فِي اهْلِ بَيْتِ نَبِيِّكَ\nLA-A’NAL LAAHO MAN A-A’NATAKA FEE AHLE BAYTE NABIYYEKA\nMay Allah curse those who caused you distress when they harmed the Household of your Prophet.\nلَعَنَ ٱللَّهُ مَنْ لاَمَكَ فِي سَادَاتِكَ\nLA-A’NAL LAAHO MAL LAAMAKA FEE SAADAATEKA\nMay Allah curse those who blamed you for your having followed your chiefs.\nلَعَنَ ٱللَّهُ عَدُوَّ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nLA-A’NAL LAAHO A’DUWWA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nMay Allah curse the enemy of Muhammad’s Family\nمِنَ ٱلْجِنِّ وَٱلإِنْسِ\nMENAL JINNE WAL INSE\nfrom the jinn and men\nمِنَ ٱلاوَّلِينَ وَٱلآخِرِينَ\nMENAL AWWALEENA WAL AAKHEREENA\nand from the past and the last generations.\nوَضَاعَفَ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْعَذَابَ ٱلالِيمَ\nWA ZAA-A’FA A’LAYHEMUL A’ZAABAL ALEEMA\nMay Allah multiply for them the painful chastisement.\nصَلَّىٰ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ\nSALLAL LAAHO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nMay Allah bless you, O Abu-`Abdullah.\nصَلَّىٰ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَاحِبَ رَسُولِ ٱللَّهِ\nSALLAL LAAHO A’LAYKA YAA SAAHEBA RASOOLIL LAAHE\nMay Allah bless you, O companion of Allah’s Messenger.\nصَلَّىٰ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ\nSALLAL LAAHO A’LAYHE WA AALEHI\nMay Allah bless him, his Household,\nوَعَلَيْكَ يَا مَوْلَىٰ امِيرِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nWA A’LAYKA YAA MAWLAA AMEERIL MOAMENEENA\nand you, O follower of the Commander of the Faithful.\nوَصَلَّىٰ ٱللَّهِ عَلَىٰ رُوحِكَ ٱلطَّيِّبَةِ\nWA SALLAL LAAHO A’LAA ROOHEKAT TAYYEBATE\nMay Allah bless your immaculate soul\nوَجَسَدِكَ ٱلطَّاهِرِ\nWA JASADEKAT TAAHERE\nand pure body,\nوَالْحَقَنَا بِمَنِّهِ وَرَافَتِهِ\nWA ALHAQANAA BE-MANNEHI WA RAAFATEHI\nand may He, out of His favoring and kindness, join us,\nإِِذَا تَوَفَّانَا بِكَ\nEZAA TAWAFFAANAA BEKA\nwhen He grasps our souls, with you\nوَبِمَحَلِّ ٱلسَّادَةِ ٱلْمَيَامِينِ\nWA BE-MAHALLIS SAADATIL MAYAAMEENE\nand with the position of the blessed chiefs,\nوَجَمَعَنَا مَعَهُمْ بِجِوَارِهِمْ فِي جَنَّاتِ ٱلنَّعيِمِ\nWA JAMA-A’NAA MA-A’HUM BE-JEWAAREHIM FEE JANNATIN NA-E’EME\nand may He gather us in their vicinity in the gardens of bliss.\nصَلَّىٰ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ\nSALLAL LAAHO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nMay Allah bless you, O Abu-`Abdullah.\nوَصَلَّىٰ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ إِِخْوَانِكَ ٱلشِّيعَةِ ٱلْبَرَرَةِ\nWA SALLAL LAAHO A’LAA IKHWAANEKASH SHEE-A’TIL BARARATE\nMay Allah also bless your brothers the dutiful partisans\nمِنَ ٱلسَّلَفِ ٱلْمَيَامِينِ\nMENAS SALAFIL MAYAAMEENE\nfrom the blessed bygone generation.\nوَادْخَلَ ٱلرَّوْحَ وَٱلرِّضْوَانَ عَلَىٰ ٱلْخَلَفِ مِنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nWA ADKHALAR RAWHA WAR RIZWAANA A’LAL KHALAFE MENAL MOAMENEENA\nMay He insert bliss and pleasure to the believers from the succeeding generations\nوَالْحَقَنَا وَإِيَّاهُمْ بِمَنْ تَوَلاَّهُ مِنْ ٱلْعِتْرَةِ ٱلطَّاهِرِينَ\nWA ALHAQANAA WA IYYAAHUM BEMAN TAWALLAAHO MENAL E’TRATIT TAAHEREENA\nand may He add them and us to the immaculate progeny to whom we have shown loyalty.\nوَعَلَيْكَ وَعَلَيْهِمُ ٱلسَّلاَمُ\nWA A’LAYKA WA A’LAYHEMUS SALAAMO\nUpon you and them be peace\nوَرَحْمَةُ ٱللَّهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ\nWA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nand Allah’s mercy and blessings.\nYou may then repeat [Surah al-Qadr](A101) (No. 97) seven times and then offer any voluntary prayer you wish. When you decide to leave, you may stop at the tomb to bid farewell farewell to him. You may now say the following words, which Sayyid Ibn Tawus mentioned at the end of the fourth form of ziyarah of Salman:\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Abu-`Abdullah.\nانْتَ بَابُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلْمُؤْتىٰ مِنْهُ وَٱلْمَاخُوذُ عَنْهُ\nANTA BAABUL LAAHIL MOATAA MINHO WAL MAAKHOOZO A’NHO\nYou are the door to Allah from which He is reached and what He has is received.\nاشْهَدُ انَّكَ قُلْتَ حَقّاً وَنَطَقْتَ صِدْقاً\nASH-HADO ANNAKA QULTA HAQQANW WA NATAQTA SIDQAN\nI bear witness that you have said the truth, spoken honestly,\nوَدَعَوْتَ إِلَىٰ مَوْلاَيَ وَمَوْلاَكَ عَلاَنِيَةً وَسِرّاً\nWA DA-A’WTA ELAA MAWLAAYA WA MAWLAAKA A’LAANEYATANW WA SIRRAN\nand called to my and your master openly and in secret.\nاتَيْتُكَ زَائِراً\nATAYTOKA ZAAA-ERAN\nI have come to you, visiting you\nوَحَاجَاتِي لَكَ مُسْتَوْدِعاً\nWA HAAJAATEE LAKA MUSTAWDE-A’N\nand entrusting with you all my needs.\nوَهَا انَا ذَا مُوَدِّعُكَ\nWA HAA ANAA ZAA MOWADDE-O’KA\nHere I am bidding farewell to you.\nاسْتَوْدِعُكَ دِينِي وَامَانَتِي\nASTAWDE-O’KA DEENEE WA AMAANATEE\nI thus entrust with you my faith, trust,\nوَخَوَاتِيمَ عَمَلِي وَجَوَامِعَ امَلِي\nWA KHAWAATEEMA A’MALEE WA JAWAAME-A’ AMALEE\nthe seals of my deeds, and my entire hope\nإِلَىٰ مُنْتَهَىٰ اجَلِي\nELAA MUNTAHAA AJALEE\nup to the end of my lifetime.\nوَٱلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ وَرَحْمَةُ ٱللَّهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ\nWAS SALAAMO A’LAYKA WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nPeace and Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nوَصَلَّىٰ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِهِ ٱلاخْيَارِ\nWA SALLAL LAAHO A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALEHIL AKHYAARE\nMay Allah bless Muhammad and his Household, the virtuous."
}
